issing <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Portable fletcher\" href=\"#items/Portable%20fletcher\">Portable fletcher</a>s and <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Brooch of the Gods\" href=\"#items/Brooch%20of%20the%20Gods\">Brooch of the Gods</a>: -25,401,904 gp</li><li>Missing <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Brooch of the Gods\" href=\"#items/Brooch%20of%20the%20Gods\">Brooch of the Gods</a>: -12,700,952 gp</li><li>Missing <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Fletching cape\" href=\"#items/Fletching%20cape\">Fletching cape</a>  perk: -857,400 gp</li><li>Missing <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ranger&#x27;s_Workroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ranger&#x27;s Workroom</a> tier 2 or not fletching inside it: -3,429,600 gp</li></ul>","post":"<p>These can be used to train <a class=\"tl\" href=\"#train/Magic\">Magic</a> due to their moderate Grand Exchange limit, but they can also be created to train the <a class=\"tl\" href=\"#train/Fletching\">Fletching</a> skill and maintain a profit.</p><p>Players with the <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Fletching cape\" href=\"#items/Fletching%20cape\">Fletching cape</a> have a chance at creating more bolts as the cape provides a 0.75% chance to make extra bolts, this is roughly an extra 150 × bolts per 20,000 made.</p><p>Using a portable fletcher saves roughly 1110 x <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Bakriminel bolts\" href=\"#items/Bakriminel%20bolts\">Bakriminel bolts</a> and 1110 x bolt tips for every 10,000 tipped bolts, which remain on the inventory.</p><p>It's possible to fletch up to 27000 per hour, but bear in mind that the GE buy limit for bolt tips is 10k, and bakriminel bolts is 1k each 4 hours, so in order to make this much, you'll have to buy the ingredients beforehand.</p><p>To find the current location of a <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Portable fletcher\" href=\"#items/Portable%20fletcher\">portable fletcher</a>, ask in the \"portables\" <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Friends_chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Friends chat</a>, or check Fort Forinthry or Lumbridge market in world 84.</p><p>Consider Magic training (and potentially making more profit) by <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Enchanting_bakriminel_bolts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">enchanting the bolts</a> afterwards.</p><p>Like with all processing moneymakers it's worth testing the method on a small sample before purchasing a large amount.  Bear in mind that bakriminel bolts have been largely outclassed by <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Elder_God_arrows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Elder God arrows</a> and the <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Bow of the Last Guardian\" href=\"#items/Bow%20of%20the%20Last%20Guardian\">Bow of the Last Guardian</a>, causing their demand and trade volume to drop significantly.</p>","it":[["Hydrix bakriminel bolts","gicons/fd4ee659aee6.webp"],["Portable fletcher","gicons/1d3ab34a7966.webp"],["Brooch of the Gods","gicons/5b9b45602144.webp"],["Fletching cape","gicons/08c0cefb39ce.webp"],["Bakriminel bolts","gicons/3da1943589ab.webp"],["Bow of the Last Guardian","gicons/ac766e5201b3.webp"]],"qs":[],"ms":[],"wl":["Ranger's Workroom","Friends chat","Money making guide/Enchanting bakriminel bolts","Elder God arrows"],"ts":"2026-07-21","ge_miss":[],"un":[],"xs":["Fletching"]}]},{"pre":"","m":[{"id":"transmuting-onyx-dust","t":"Transmuting onyx dust","g":"rec","pg":"Money making guide/Transmuting onyx dust","v":"","sub":"","mem":1,"iy":0,"tg":["rec"],"wf":"c","pw":35358857,"at":0.35,"rt":"4 hours","run":206260,"rq":[{"k":"s","s":"Divination","l":97,"p":"s"}],"xp":[{"s":"Divination","x":234,"h":234}],"inp":[{"n":"Onyx dust","q":1000,"k":0,"ic":"icons/9c8013295ae2.webp","a":1},{"n":"Incandescent energy","q":2500,"k":0,"ic":"icons/49321ae543f8.webp","a":1}],"out":[{"n":"Uncut onyx","q":10,"k":0,"ic":"icons/c57cab61e581.webp","a":1}],"tin":10262500,"tout":10468760,"pic":["mimg/cf9fa70bb322.webp"],"h":"<p><a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Onyx dust\" href=\"#items/Onyx%20dust\">Onyx dust</a> is commonly dropped from <a class=\"ml\" href=\"#drops/Raksha%2C%20the%20Shadow%20Colossus\">Raksha</a>, <a class=\"ml\" href=\"#drops/Arch-Glacor\">Arch-Glacor</a>, <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Croesus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Croesus</a>, <a class=\"ml\" href=\"#drops/TzKal-Zuk\">TzKal-Zuk</a>, <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/elite_dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">elite dungeons</a>, and <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rasial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rasial</a>. 100 dust is needed to make an uncut onyx. There is a 1,000 buy limit per four hours. To work around this, players can let the order fill while doing other activities, trade directly with other players, or use alternate accounts.</p><p>Using 250 <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Incandescent energy\" href=\"#items/Incandescent%20energy\">incandescent energy</a> to <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/transmute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">transmute</a> 100 onyx dust into 1 uncut onyx yields a profit of 1068240 - 985500 - 40750 gp. Because transmutation takes 2.4 seconds, players can theoretically make up to 1,500 uncut onyx per hour, resulting in a potential profit of 1500 * (1068240 - 985500 - 40750) gp.</p><p>A <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Modified diviner&#x27;s headwear\" href=\"#items/Modified%20diviner&#x27;s%20headwear\">modified diviner&#x27;s headwear</a> will reduce costs by 8,150 gp by saving incandescent energy 5% of the time. The <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/diviner&#x27;s_outfit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">diviner&#x27;s outfit</a> will also increase experience gained by up to 6%.</p>","post":"<h5>Calculator</h5><p><a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Calculator:Divination/Transmuting_onyx_dust\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Transmuting onyx dust</a></p>","it":[["Onyx dust","icons/9c8013295ae2.webp"],["Incandescent energy","icons/49321ae543f8.webp"],["Modified diviner's headwear","icons/1bf20e9834dc.webp"]],"qs":[],"ms":["Raksha, the Shadow Colossus","Arch-Glacor","TzKal-Zuk"],"wl":["Divination","Raksha, the Shadow Colossus","Arch-Glacor","Croesus","TzKal-Zuk","Elite dungeons","Rasial","Transmute","Diviner's outfit","Calculator:Divination/Transmuting onyx dust"],"ts":"2026-08-06","ge_miss":[],"un":[],"xs":["Divination"]}]},{"pre":"","m":[{"id":"using-the-auto-disassembler-mk-ii-to-make-empty-divine-charge","t":"Using the auto disassembler mk. II to make divine charge (empty)","g":"rec","pg":"Money making guide/Using the auto disassembler mk. II to make empty divine charge","v":"","sub":"","mem":1,"iy":1,"tg":["afk","rec"],"wf":"c","pw":7310061,"at":32.0,"rt":"216 hours","run":3898699,"rq":[{"k":"s","s":"Invention","l":101,"nt":"for empty divine charges","p":"s"},{"k":"s","s":"Invention","l":105,"nt":"for junk chance reduction 9","p":"s"},{"k":"o","h":"Built an <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/auto_disassembler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">auto disassembler</a> then an <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/auto_disassembler_mk._II\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">auto disassembler mk. II</a>","p":"o"},{"k":"o","h":"Built a <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/simple_generator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">simple generator</a> and filled it with charge","p":"o"}],"xp":[{"s":"Invention","x":92040,"h":92040}],"inp":[{"n":"Maple logs","q":26000,"k":0,"ic":"icons/ed8b83672572.webp","a":1},{"n":"Divine charge","q":34,"k":0,"ic":"gicons/ae6039ae1677.webp","a":1}],"out":[{"n":"Divine charge (empty)","q":767,"k":0,"ic":"gicons/8eea794b0409.webp","a":1}],"tin":11027888,"tout":14926587,"pic":["mimg/cf3340c43de1.webp"],"h":"<p><b>This guide assumes use of the auto disassembler mk. II.</b> The profit gained from this activity will be lower than shown on this page if you are using the regular auto disassembler.</p><p>You will first need to have built a <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/auto_disassembler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">auto disassembler</a>, then create the <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/auto_disassembler_mk._II\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">auto disassembler mk. II</a>. You can build an auto disassembler mk. II in the <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Invention_Guild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Invention Guild</a> with 81 <a class=\"tl\" href=\"#train/Invention\">Invention</a>. However, this guide assumes that you have 105 Invention to have researched <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Divine-o-matic_vacuum_and_empty_Divine_charge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">empty divine charge blueprint</a> and <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Junk_chance_reduction#9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">junk chance reduction 9</a>.</p><p>26,000 <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Maple logs\" href=\"#items/Maple%20logs\">maple logs</a> will be disassembled in 9 days, taking 34 <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Divine charge\" href=\"#items/Divine%20charge\">divine charge</a>s and producing 15,340 <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/simple_parts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">simple parts</a> which will make 767 <a class=\"ti\" data-i=\"Divine charge (empty)\" href=\"#items/Divine%20charge%20(empty)\">divine charge (empty)</a>. It takes 30 minutes to create the divine charges, and 2 minutes to add the logs and collect the parts. This guide assumes the use of two disassemblers, so halve all numbers if using a single machine.</p><p>With a <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/jumbo_generator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">jumbo generator</a>, up to three machines can be run at a time, potentially resulting in multiplying the profit, at the expense of being limited in terms of what other machines can be used. Additionally, with a fully upgraded <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Workshop_(Fort_Forinthry)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Workshop</a> in <a class=\"wl\" href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fort_Forinthry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fort Forinthry</a>, five can be used, but there will be no power left for any other machines.</p><p>To allow profit to be easily calculated for any combination of machines, this page calculates profit on a per-machine basis.</p>","it":[["Divine charge (empty)","gicons/8eea794b0409.webp"],["Maple logs","icons/ed8b83672572.webp"],["Divine charge","gicons/ae6039ae1677.webp"]],"qs":[],"ms":[],"wl":["Auto disassembler mk. II","Junk chance reduction","Auto disassembler","Simple generator","Invention Guild","Divine-o-matic vacuum and empty Divine charge","Simple parts","Jumbo generator","Workshop (Fort Forinthry)","Fort Forinthry"],"ts":"2025-07-30","ge_miss":[],"un":[],"xs":["Invention"]}]}]}